IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `isa-misuse`

-- Intoxicating Substances Act 1987, ss 2-4, 10(4), 13, 14, 16, 17, 26A, 26B, 39, 41, 42 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_intoxicating-substances-act-1987.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

